{"overview":"Two families, abolitionist Northerners the Stonemans and Southern landowners the Camerons, intertwine. When Confederate colonel Ben Cameron is captured in battle, nurse Elsie Stoneman petitions for his pardon. In Reconstruction-era South Carolina, Cameron founds the Ku Klux Klan, battling Elsie's congressman father and his African-American protégé, Silas Lynch.","tagline":"The Fiery Cross of the Ku Klux Klan!","cast":[{"n":"Lillian Gish","c":"Stoneman's Daughter Elsie","p":"/xUBj1vajDHS8GntuBzhpztRMVy4.jpg","q":"Q104183"},{"n":"Mae Marsh","c":"Flora Cameron","p":"/1PDFSBQCwJ1yteuffEJgwSrAVra.jpg","q":"Q153332"},{"n":"Henry B. Walthall","c":"Col. Ben Cameron","p":"/v8G0OotHtSpp4iB2CBwWl9LFVkW.jpg","q":"Q661678"},{"n":"Miriam Cooper","c":"Margaret Cameron","p":"/kJtdYZYTJV51qPleIMeKvdv2WHh.jpg","q":"Q452455"},{"n":"Mary Alden","c":"Stoneman's Housekeeper Lydia","p":"/5pKYYHf6h7aiEJ8mFom39ihPY9m.jpg","q":"Q641612"},{"n":"Ralph Lewis","c":"Leader of the House Hon. Austin Stoneman","p":"/hcZEuTJlj57Eapbtp103IMq7DVP.jpg","q":"Q684079"},{"n":"George Siegmann","c":"Lieut. Governor Silas Lynch","p":"/ekmTjMAXd71x4KSrFVfkc90vzDP.jpg","q":"Q745994"},{"n":"Walter Long","c":"Gus","p":"/oS2Ip4I7H5MQhKQcTNXVqMK62Im.jpg","q":"Q574529"},{"n":"Robert Harron","c":"Tod","p":"/8uqveFAwItcd5Ty2OEMPM37bbZb.jpg","q":"Q1344716"},{"n":"Wallace Reid","c":"Jeff, the Blacksmith","p":"/dE0MD7mJe8VmRIxoxvfTyqrAl3p.jpg","q":"Q947766"}],"country":["United States"],"language":["English"],"wiki":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Birth_of_a_Nation","qid":"Q220394","rel":{"AE":{"d":"2013-07-23"},"AR":{"d":"1917-04-27","c":"ATP"},"AU":{"d":"1915-08-09","c":"PG"},"BR":{"d":"1917-05-21","c":"12"},"CA":{"d":"1915-06-08","c":"PG"},"CZ":{"d":"2023-02-09","c":"15+"},"DE":{"d":"1915-05-20","c":"0"},"DK":{"d":"1918-03-22","c":"A"},"ES":{"d":"1921-10-12"},"FI":{"d":"1922-04-15","c":"K-16"},"FR":{"d":"1920-10-21","c":"TP"},"GB":{"d":"1915-03-08","c":"U"},"GR":{"d":"1915-12-14","c":"13"},"HU":{"d":"1